  "term": "autonomic reactivity",
  "definition": "Autonomic reactivity is the way the autonomic nervous system changes in response to a stimulus, especially emotionally meaningful material. In this study, it meant shifts in heart rate variability during emotional compared with neutral memory scripts.",
